    "office": "The office and seat, from the contest record.",
    "deadline": "The filing deadline, from the contest record, as people say a date.",
    "fee": "The filing fee in dollars, from the contest record.",
    "signatures": "The number of petition signatures, from the contest record.",
    "age": "The minimum age, from the eligibility rule.",
    "place": "Where a candidate must live, from the eligibility rule.",
